  "question": {
    "html": "<p>X and Y are two parallel copper wires that both carry current <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span> out of the plane of the page. The magnitude of the force exerted per unit length by X on Y is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the force exerted per unit length by Y on X when the current in both wires is doubled, the distance between the wires is halved and the current direction in Y is reversed?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2F\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4F\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8F\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
